*.iopin vdd
*.iopin vss
*.iopin ck
*.iopin inp
*.iopin inn
*.iopin outp
*.iopin outn
*.iopin iref
x2 vdd inp inn iref net1 net2 vss preamp_singleslope
x1 vdd ck outp outn net1 net2 vss latch_singleslope
.ends

.GLOBAL GND
.end
